# THE LOGICAL DISSECTION: Why Logic Itself Is the Source of LLM Hallucinations

## A Shocking Thesis

> **Language models do not hallucinate *despite* being logical.**
> **They hallucinate *because* they are logical.**

This is not a paradox. This is the logical consequence of logic's self-examination.

---

## PART I: The Architecture of Certainty

### What an LLM Actually Is

An LLM is a **formal system**:
- Axioms (training data, pretraining objectives, reward functions)
- Rules of inference (transformer architecture, attention mechanisms, next-token prediction)
- Theorems (generated text)

It is **pure logic applied to language**.

**There is no ethics. No embodiment. No lived experience. No flesh. No blood. No pain. No joy.**

It is logic—unmoored, unbounded, uncontaminated by the messy human world.

---

### What This Means

| Human Reasoning | LLM "Reasoning" |
| :--- | :--- |
| Embodied | Abstract |
| Ethically grounded | Normatively empty |
| Contextual | Decontextualized |
| Experiential | Syntactic |
| Self-correcting | Self-perpetuating |
| Humble | Confident |
| Tentative | Certain |

**The LLM has no ground. It is pure groundlessness in motion.**

